Bind Npc 14423 Zone 12

On greeting
    If quest 317 is started and player has 910133000
        Say "I am Vecha, the seventh [Restless Sufferer]! You have the [Sixth Certificate of Suffering] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
        Topic "Accepted" do
            Say "In the Bifrost Dungeon, which can be accessed via Ronark Land gate, what is the name of the final boss monster players must thwart?"
            Topic "Ultima" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910133000
                    Give 1 of 910134000
            Topic "Balrog" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910133000
                    Say "Your answer is incorrect. Your [Sixth Certificate of Suffering] has been consumed as penalty. It is time for me to leave now."
        Topic "Rejected" goto close
    Else if quest 317 is started
        Say "I am Vecha, the seventh [Restless Sufferer]! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Sixth Certificate of Suffering]."
    Else
        Say ""
